WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.351 --> 00:00:03.171
(whooshing)

00:00:03.171 --> 00:00:04.813
- I love that message about not starting

00:00:04.813 --> 00:00:07.806
the day with email and starting
at 10:30 or 11 o'clock,

00:00:07.806 --> 00:00:09.675
what then do you recommend that

00:00:09.675 --> 00:00:12.385
entrepreneurs do start their day with?

00:00:12.385 --> 00:00:15.811
- Well, I'll give you
a very simple process.

00:00:15.811 --> 00:00:20.192
I was teaching this to
someone in Japan yesterday.

00:00:20.192 --> 00:00:23.289
Actually, a very large number
of people in Japan yesterday.

00:00:23.289 --> 00:00:26.166
And it starts with a
piece of paper and you.

00:00:26.166 --> 00:00:30.083
A piece of paper and a
pen, will make you rich.

00:00:31.161 --> 00:00:32.364
We won't go into goal setting,

00:00:32.364 --> 00:00:33.804
it's a whole separate process.

00:00:33.804 --> 00:00:37.023
But make a list of everything
you have to do tomorrow.

00:00:37.023 --> 00:00:39.719
The best time to make your
lists is the night before.

00:00:39.719 --> 00:00:42.155
If you make a list of your
whole day for tomorrow,

00:00:42.155 --> 00:00:44.809
your subconscious will
work on your list overnight

00:00:44.809 --> 00:00:46.949
and you'll wake up in
the morning with ideas

00:00:46.949 --> 00:00:49.214
and insights that are
sometimes quite amazing.

00:00:49.214 --> 00:00:51.213
So you make a list, and
then you look at the list,

00:00:51.213 --> 00:00:53.397
and you ask this simple question.

00:00:53.397 --> 00:00:55.959
If I could only do one thing on this list

00:00:55.959 --> 00:00:58.483
before I was called out
of town for a month,

00:00:58.483 --> 00:01:01.729
which one task would I want
to be sure to get completed,

00:01:01.729 --> 00:01:03.948
and put a circle around that.

00:01:03.948 --> 00:01:05.480
Now, when you get up in the morning,

00:01:05.480 --> 00:01:06.868
whatever time you start,

00:01:06.868 --> 00:01:09.399
and that's a very interesting point.

00:01:09.399 --> 00:01:13.149
Wealthy people get up
in the morning by 6 am.

00:01:14.025 --> 00:01:17.097
Poor people get up at 7 or afterwords.

00:01:17.097 --> 00:01:18.660
Wealthy people get up earlier,

00:01:18.660 --> 00:01:20.839
poor people get up later, real simple.

00:01:20.839 --> 00:01:22.511
So if you're getting up around 7 o'clock,

00:01:22.511 --> 00:01:24.581
you're always going to be poor,

00:01:24.581 --> 00:01:26.507
for the simple reason by
the time you get started

00:01:26.507 --> 00:01:29.385
the day's half finished, and
now you're checking your email

00:01:29.385 --> 00:01:30.452
and you're talking to your friends,

00:01:30.452 --> 00:01:32.236
and then it's lunch time, and coffee time,

00:01:32.236 --> 00:01:35.021
and span time, and everything else.

00:01:35.021 --> 00:01:37.966
Get up at 6 o'clock and develop a ritual.

00:01:37.966 --> 00:01:40.979
Get up, exercise, then sit, plan your day,

00:01:40.979 --> 00:01:43.780
get organized, and start
to hit it at 8 o'clock.

00:01:43.780 --> 00:01:45.615
And the first thing you do is you

00:01:45.615 --> 00:01:47.542
start on your most important task,

00:01:47.542 --> 00:01:49.717
and then you concentrate
single mindedly on that task.

00:01:49.717 --> 00:01:51.287
You do not turn on your email.

00:01:51.287 --> 00:01:53.080
You do not turn on your telephone.

00:01:53.080 --> 00:01:55.622
You don't do anything
except that one task,

00:01:55.622 --> 00:01:59.034
and you just do this one
task until it's completed.

00:01:59.034 --> 00:02:01.743
Now, you've already agreed
with yourself and the world

00:02:01.743 --> 00:02:03.670
that there is nothing
more valuable in the world

00:02:03.670 --> 00:02:06.232
that you could do than this one task.

00:02:06.232 --> 00:02:09.345
So do this, and if you develop a habit

00:02:09.345 --> 00:02:10.890
of getting up in the morning,

00:02:10.890 --> 00:02:13.138
and starting and completing
your most important task,

00:02:13.138 --> 00:02:14.627
it will transform your life.

00:02:14.627 --> 00:02:15.925
It's one of the most incredible

00:02:15.925 --> 00:02:19.094
productivity habits ever discovered.

00:02:19.094 --> 00:02:20.672
And every person who discovers it,

00:02:20.672 --> 00:02:22.482
they see their income, their productivity,

00:02:22.482 --> 00:02:26.739
their performance, and their
satisfaction just explode.

00:02:26.739 --> 00:02:27.960
It's very simple.

00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:29.980
The question is do you
have the discipline,

00:02:29.980 --> 00:02:32.194
do you have the self control,

00:02:32.194 --> 00:02:34.332
the will power to start and complete

00:02:34.332 --> 00:02:36.048
your most important task?

00:02:36.048 --> 00:02:39.237
If you don't have it, you
can develop it with practice.

00:02:39.237 --> 00:02:40.710
If you develop with practice,

00:02:40.710 --> 00:02:42.822
it soon becomes easy and automatic.

00:02:42.822 --> 00:02:44.500
And if you just do this,

00:02:44.500 --> 00:02:46.965
your productivity will
double the first day.

00:02:46.965 --> 00:02:49.298
(whooshing)

